1
00:00:21,333 --> 00:00:22,583
Eren.

2
00:00:22,583 --> 00:00:24,875
You're a man!

3
00:00:24,875 --> 00:00:29,250
Show some restraint!
You need to be there for Mikasa, too!

4
00:00:29,250 --> 00:00:33,083
Stop!

5
00:02:23,958 --> 00:02:28,958
"Scream"

6
00:02:33,333 --> 00:02:34,833
Damn that Reiner!

7
00:02:34,833 --> 00:02:37,583
He's tossing Titans like a madman!

8
00:02:52,958 --> 00:02:54,625
This is all your fault!

9
00:02:54,625 --> 00:02:59,833
It's you who screwed up my entire plan,
you damn commander!

10
00:03:07,042 --> 00:03:08,292
Ymir!

11
00:03:08,292 --> 00:03:09,542
Conny, that way!

12
00:03:09,542 --> 00:03:11,000
I know!

13
00:03:13,833 --> 00:03:15,250
Commander!

14
00:03:16,458 --> 00:03:19,083
I can always be replaced.

15
00:03:19,083 --> 00:03:22,583
More importantly, find Eren and retreat!

16
00:03:22,583 --> 00:03:24,708
Time is of the essence!

17
00:03:37,167 --> 00:03:38,583
Eren!

18
00:03:43,458 --> 00:03:44,958
Hannes!

19
00:03:51,333 --> 00:03:53,167
What are the odds of this?!

20
00:03:53,167 --> 00:03:55,542
Check it out, you two!

21
00:03:55,542 --> 00:03:56,917
You just watch.

22
00:03:56,917 --> 00:04:02,083
I'm about to avenge your mother
and butcher the shit out of this!

23
00:04:05,833 --> 00:04:08,000
Hannes!

24
00:04:08,000 --> 00:04:10,375
Give the old man backup!

25
00:04:10,375 --> 00:04:11,458
Huh?!

26
00:04:18,167 --> 00:04:21,125
Reiner? What's he doing?!

27
00:04:21,125 --> 00:04:23,750
Does he not care if Eren is eaten?!

28
00:04:23,750 --> 00:04:28,083
Don't get in our way, you big sack of shit!

29
00:04:35,583 --> 00:04:36,917
Ymir!

30
00:04:38,375 --> 00:04:41,667
Dammit... What am I supposed to do?

31
00:04:41,667 --> 00:04:46,708
If I can't count on Reiner, should I cooperate
with the Scouts and try to survive?

32
00:04:49,292 --> 00:04:52,708
But what happens after that?

33
00:04:52,708 --> 00:04:55,958
Even if I can somehow live through all this...

34
00:04:55,958 --> 00:05:01,083
...there's no avoiding the hell
that's to come trapped inside the walls.

35
00:05:01,083 --> 00:05:05,167
Now's my only chance
to hand Historia over to their side!

36
00:05:05,167 --> 00:05:09,458
I won't be able to protect her alone,
no matter how hard I try.

37
00:05:13,917 --> 00:05:15,500
Christa!

38
00:05:15,500 --> 00:05:17,750
Conny, that's wrong.

39
00:05:17,750 --> 00:05:21,125
My name is Historia.

40
00:05:21,125 --> 00:05:24,083
Hey, Ymir...

41
00:05:24,083 --> 00:05:27,917
Why was it you were trying to take me away?

42
00:05:27,917 --> 00:05:31,333
You said it was to save yourself,
but was that a lie?

43
00:05:32,917 --> 00:05:35,875
No... it has to be.

44
00:05:36,917 --> 00:05:40,583
Why? Why did you do it?

45
00:05:44,292 --> 00:05:46,000
For me?

46
00:05:47,167 --> 00:05:50,250
To protect me again?

47
00:05:50,250 --> 00:05:51,833
It's a Titan!

48
00:05:54,583 --> 00:05:56,042
Ymir...

49
00:05:56,042 --> 00:05:59,958
You're the one who said it,
so listen to yourself!

50
00:06:01,167 --> 00:06:03,708
Stop living for other people!

51
00:06:03,708 --> 00:06:08,792
From now on, let's live for nobody but ourselves!

52
00:06:08,792 --> 00:06:10,917
It's strange, really...

53
00:06:10,917 --> 00:06:14,917
When I'm with you,
no matter how screwed up it gets...

54
00:06:14,917 --> 00:06:16,792
...I'm not afraid!

55
00:06:24,417 --> 00:06:25,792
Shit!

56
00:06:36,750 --> 00:06:39,708
Don't, Mikasa! You're injured!

57
00:06:41,375 --> 00:06:43,042
Untie my hands!

58
00:06:43,042 --> 00:06:44,792
Hands?

59
00:06:44,792 --> 00:06:46,083
Hurry up!

60
00:06:46,083 --> 00:06:49,042
I've gotta be the one to do it!

61
00:06:50,292 --> 00:06:52,917
Who said I was done with you?!

62
00:06:54,792 --> 00:06:56,792
That one's... mine!

63
00:06:56,792 --> 00:06:58,500
Eren!

64
00:06:58,500 --> 00:07:01,833
Wait! We're trying to get you out of here!

65
00:07:01,833 --> 00:07:04,125
It's time to settle the score!

66
00:07:04,125 --> 00:07:05,500
Just watch!

67
00:07:14,083 --> 00:07:15,875
Huh?!

68
00:07:21,583 --> 00:07:23,125
Commander!

69
00:07:23,125 --> 00:07:24,625
The Armored one is--

70
00:07:25,625 --> 00:07:27,458
It's coming!

71
00:07:31,208 --> 00:07:32,333
Jean!

72
00:07:37,292 --> 00:07:38,583
Jean!

73
00:07:39,833 --> 00:07:41,708
Are you okay?!

74
00:07:41,708 --> 00:07:43,708
Hold it together!

75
00:07:48,875 --> 00:07:50,708
Shit!

76
00:07:50,708 --> 00:07:52,458
Shit!

77
00:07:53,583 --> 00:07:55,333
What's wrong?!

78
00:07:59,000 --> 00:08:00,417
Eren!

79
00:08:20,292 --> 00:08:21,917
Commander!

80
00:08:42,000 --> 00:08:43,500
Right now...

81
00:08:43,500 --> 00:08:45,750
...I've gotta become a Titan...

82
00:08:48,458 --> 00:08:50,667
...or it's all for nothing!

83
00:09:33,125 --> 00:09:35,333
Eren...

84
00:09:35,333 --> 00:09:37,125
Nothing changed!

85
00:09:37,125 --> 00:09:40,917
You haven't changed one bit, dammit!

86
00:09:40,917 --> 00:09:44,458
You're still as useless as you ever were!

87
00:09:45,875 --> 00:09:48,208
Nothing changed!

88
00:09:58,667 --> 00:10:00,708
Mom...

89
00:10:00,708 --> 00:10:03,875
I... can't...

90
00:10:03,875 --> 00:10:08,417
I still... can't do anything at all.

91
00:10:08,417 --> 00:10:09,833
Eren...

92
00:10:16,958 --> 00:10:19,333
That's not true.

93
00:10:38,833 --> 00:10:41,250
Eren...

94
00:10:41,250 --> 00:10:42,833
Listen...

95
00:10:44,042 --> 00:10:46,375
...I need to tell you something.

96
00:10:50,833 --> 00:10:54,833
You've always... been at my side.

97
00:10:54,833 --> 00:10:56,458
Thank you.

98
00:11:00,292 --> 00:11:06,083
You showed me... how to live with purpose.

99
00:11:06,083 --> 00:11:07,875
Thank you.

100
00:11:13,125 --> 00:11:14,792
And you...

101
00:11:17,833 --> 00:11:20,250
You wrapped this scarf around me.

102
00:11:20,250 --> 00:11:22,000
Thank you.

103
00:11:44,417 --> 00:11:49,000
I'll wrap that around you...
as many times as you want.

104
00:11:51,208 --> 00:11:55,500
Now and forever... As much as you want!

105
00:12:57,333 --> 00:13:00,500
Why... are they...?

106
00:13:00,500 --> 00:13:02,417
They're eating it?

107
00:13:07,917 --> 00:13:10,458
Dunno what's going on, but now's our chance!

108
00:13:10,458 --> 00:13:11,875
Let's hurry and run!

109
00:13:11,875 --> 00:13:13,125
Right!

110
00:13:13,125 --> 00:13:15,167
So that's how it is...

111
00:13:15,167 --> 00:13:18,875
That's why Reiner was so desperate for Eren.

112
00:13:18,875 --> 00:13:22,208
Which means, even inside the walls...

113
00:13:22,208 --> 00:13:24,083
...there's a future.

114
00:13:27,958 --> 00:13:30,167
This is the worst...

115
00:13:30,167 --> 00:13:35,375
Why did the Coordinate have to fall into
the hands of the worst person imaginable?

116
00:13:35,375 --> 00:13:37,833
We've gotta get it back...

117
00:13:37,833 --> 00:13:41,458
I can say... without a doubt...

118
00:13:41,458 --> 00:13:44,833
...the one person in the world
I wouldn't want to have it...

119
00:13:44,833 --> 00:13:48,417
...Eren... is you!

120
00:13:48,417 --> 00:13:51,083
Get away from me!

121
00:13:51,083 --> 00:13:54,458
You bastards! I'll kill you all!

122
00:14:03,042 --> 00:14:06,625
Not good! Bertholdt!

123
00:14:06,625 --> 00:14:08,625
I can't protect Bertholdt like this!

124
00:14:08,625 --> 00:14:10,583
What? The Titans?

125
00:14:10,583 --> 00:14:11,750
Eren!

126
00:14:13,083 --> 00:14:13,875
Get on!

127
00:14:13,875 --> 00:14:15,958
Armin!

128
00:14:15,958 --> 00:14:17,708
Hurry!

129
00:14:17,708 --> 00:14:19,875
Don't let this chance escape!

130
00:14:19,875 --> 00:14:21,958
Full retreat!

131
00:14:30,417 --> 00:14:32,042
Ymir!

132
00:14:32,042 --> 00:14:35,875
Hey, ugly! What are you doing?!
We're heading back!

133
00:14:46,167 --> 00:14:49,625
I sorry...

134
00:14:49,625 --> 00:14:51,167
Huh?

135
00:14:56,042 --> 00:14:58,250
Ymir! Where are you going?!

136
00:14:58,250 --> 00:14:58,875
Leave her!

137
00:14:58,875 --> 00:15:00,708
But Ymir is--

138
00:15:21,833 --> 00:15:28,208
In that moment, I couldn't understand
the motivation behind Ymir's actions...

139
00:15:28,208 --> 00:15:32,500
...but the Armored Titan
didn't pursue us any further.

140
00:15:52,958 --> 00:15:58,000
"Through extensive research, it has become clear
that the scourge of Titans are of human origin."

141
00:16:13,458 --> 00:16:15,042
Ymir...

142
00:16:15,042 --> 00:16:17,833
Why did you come to us?

143
00:16:17,833 --> 00:16:20,625
Oh, well...

144
00:16:20,625 --> 00:16:23,208
It's because I'm an idiot.

145
00:16:23,208 --> 00:16:27,667
I'll be your souvenir to take back home.

146
00:16:27,667 --> 00:16:31,333
You can't just go back empty-handed.

147
00:16:31,333 --> 00:16:33,458
Ymir...

148
00:16:33,458 --> 00:16:37,000
If you hadn't come to bust up this wall...

149
00:16:37,000 --> 00:16:41,292
...I would've never woken up
from that nightmare.

150
00:16:41,292 --> 00:16:43,833
All I'm doing...

151
00:16:43,833 --> 00:16:47,458
...is returning what I borrowed back then.

152
00:16:48,625 --> 00:16:53,875
Because I'm probably the only one
that understands the situation you're in.

153
00:16:55,500 --> 00:16:58,792
Thank you, Ymir.

154
00:16:58,792 --> 00:17:01,375
I'm sorry...

155
00:17:01,375 --> 00:17:02,958
No...

156
00:17:06,292 --> 00:17:10,542
It wasn't so bad, you know...
being a goddess for a while.

157
00:17:15,000 --> 00:17:19,333
With reports declaring the possibility
that Wall Rose has been breached,

158
00:17:19,333 --> 00:17:25,750
the citizens of Wall Rose were forced to take
refuge in an underground city within Wall Sina.

159
00:17:26,792 --> 00:17:33,625
However, with more than half the population
surviving off food stockpiled for emergency,

160
00:17:33,625 --> 00:17:37,167
rations would last at most for a week.

161
00:17:37,167 --> 00:17:45,167
Any longer than that, and people would turn on
each other, stealing and killing to survive.

162
00:17:45,167 --> 00:17:49,875
To stop this from happening,
within one week from the initial outset,

163
00:17:49,875 --> 00:17:54,167
authorities declared that Wall Rose was secure.

164
00:17:55,167 --> 00:17:59,208
"Trost District"

165
00:18:05,792 --> 00:18:07,167
It's Hange.

166
00:18:07,167 --> 00:18:08,583
Come in.

167
00:18:08,583 --> 00:18:11,000
Pardon the interruption, Erwin.

168
00:18:13,000 --> 00:18:17,167
I'm glad we came while you're here,
Commander Pyxis.

169
00:18:17,167 --> 00:18:19,750
Good timing. This is...

170
00:18:19,750 --> 00:18:23,583
A Scout from the 104th. Conny Springer.

171
00:18:23,583 --> 00:18:27,333
Conny comes from Ragako Village.

172
00:18:27,333 --> 00:18:30,667
The village the recent
Titan invasion originated from?

173
00:18:30,667 --> 00:18:32,167
Yes.

174
00:18:32,167 --> 00:18:37,000
Actually, I confirmed with him the findings
of our investigation on the village.

175
00:18:37,000 --> 00:18:40,333
This only brings further credibility
to that hypothesis.

176
00:18:40,333 --> 00:18:42,875
He's come to report.

177
00:18:47,167 --> 00:18:49,750
I was taken away...

178
00:18:49,750 --> 00:18:56,708
And because of that, the Scouts lost
more than half their veteran soldiers.

179
00:18:56,708 --> 00:18:59,208
Just to rescue me...

180
00:19:01,083 --> 00:19:05,208
Still, there were no casualties on our way back.

181
00:19:05,208 --> 00:19:10,875
The Titans completely ignored us
and ran off to chase Reiner and the others.

182
00:19:10,875 --> 00:19:15,250
About that, Jean and I sat down
to try and figure it out.

183
00:19:16,833 --> 00:19:21,208
We have an idea what made
the Titans act that way.

184
00:19:21,208 --> 00:19:22,917
It was you.

185
00:19:24,583 --> 00:19:26,958
Of course, that's just our theory.

186
00:19:27,917 --> 00:19:32,958
But without assuming that,
there's just no explaining what happened.

187
00:19:34,208 --> 00:19:36,958
It's a tough spot to be in, Eren.

188
00:19:36,958 --> 00:19:40,500
Whether or not all those
people died for nothing...

189
00:19:40,500 --> 00:19:43,542
...it all depends on you.

190
00:19:43,542 --> 00:19:48,042
If you're worth the price they paid,
you better show it.

191
00:19:49,250 --> 00:19:51,500
We don't have time to waste.

192
00:19:56,500 --> 00:19:59,917
Yeah, you're absolutely right.

193
00:20:01,375 --> 00:20:03,125
I've gotta do this.

194
00:20:03,125 --> 00:20:05,542
I'll control the Titans.

195
00:20:05,542 --> 00:20:07,792
I'll plug up Wall Maria.

196
00:20:07,792 --> 00:20:11,833
I'll capture Reiner and make him pay.

197
00:20:11,833 --> 00:20:16,375
That's what I've gotta do
to atone for all those lives lost.

198
00:20:18,750 --> 00:20:20,208
Say again?

199
00:20:21,417 --> 00:20:26,583
The Titans responsible for this incident...
were the citizens of Ragako?

200
00:20:28,333 --> 00:20:32,417
In other words, the true identity of Titans...

201
00:20:32,417 --> 00:20:34,833
...is humans?

202
00:20:37,542 --> 00:20:41,083
We don't... have proof yet.

203
00:20:41,083 --> 00:20:44,292
So... you're telling me...

204
00:20:44,292 --> 00:20:51,792
...I've spent all this time and energy
running around killing people?

205
00:20:51,792 --> 00:20:53,500
Is that right?

206
00:20:54,750 --> 00:20:57,625
I said we don't have proof yet.

207
00:21:08,333 --> 00:21:09,833
Erwin.

208
00:21:12,708 --> 00:21:16,125
Hey. Tell me.

209
00:21:16,125 --> 00:21:18,250
The hell you smiling for?

210
00:21:22,208 --> 00:21:24,417
It's nothing.

211
00:21:26,542 --> 00:21:28,542
It's just...

212
00:21:28,542 --> 00:21:33,292
...with this, we've taken
one more step towards the truth.

213
00:21:34,583 --> 00:21:36,958
Just one step, huh?

214
00:21:36,958 --> 00:21:40,583
We'll run out of people
before we learn the truth.

215
00:21:40,583 --> 00:21:43,417
It's not worth the cost.

216
00:21:43,417 --> 00:21:46,792
But it is a step towards the truth.

217
00:21:46,792 --> 00:21:50,708
One day, we'll break it down.

218
00:21:50,708 --> 00:21:53,375
This wall hiding the truth...

219
00:21:54,542 --> 00:21:55,958
...will fall.

220
00:22:25,292 --> 00:23:57,120
Not yet, eh?
